---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Operation 17:2 Privacy Policy.">
    <PageHero label="Legal" title="Privacy Policy" />

    <section class="section-container py-16">
        <div class="prose prose-invert mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-6 text-white/70">
            <p><em>[Draft — requires legal review before launch]</em></p>
            <p>Operation 17:2 ("we," "our," or "us") respects your privacy. This policy describes how we collect, use, and protect personal information submitted through our website, applications, donations, and shop.</p>
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg uppercase text-white">Information We Collect</h3>
            <p>We may collect name, email, phone, address, payment information, application responses, and volunteer screening data as necessary to operate our mission.</p>
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg uppercase text-white">How We Use Information</h3>
            <p>Information is used to process donations, fulfill orders, review volunteer applications, conduct background checks, communicate about prayer calls and events, and comply with legal obligations.</p>
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg uppercase text-white">Data Security</h3>
            <p>We use industry-standard security measures and trusted third-party platforms (Shopify, Givebutter, volunteer screening providers) for sensitive data handling.</p>
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg uppercase text-white">Contact</h3>
            <p>Questions about this policy? <a href="/contact" class="text-brand-blue">Contact us</a>.</p>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
